# SSH on purpose: deploy providers (Vercel) auto-clone public HTTPS submodules on every deploy
# (~1.5GB, dwarfing the build itself) but cannot fetch over SSH — they warn and skip instead.
# Local init needs a GitHub SSH key; without one, rewrite to HTTPS first:
#   git config url."https://github.com/".insteadOf "git@github.com:"
[submodule "packages/gltf-samples"]
	path = packages/gltf-samples
	url = git@github.com:KhronosGroup/glTF-Sample-Assets.git
	shallow = true
